From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Miguel Fuertes <hkfuertes@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:16:39 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] echo: add raw ALSA backend with external controls

Keep PCM routing and XRUN GPIO recovery in the backend, but delegate volume, mute and speaker amplification to a separate Echo control service.

Upstream: not applicable (Amazon Echo hardware only)

Signed-off-by: Miguel Fuertes <hkfuertes@users.noreply.github.com>
---
